        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grade 2 Touch Bar Rim Exit Device  for 38\" - 48\" Commercial Doors</b>\r\n<p>\r\nDoor Controls EDTBAR44 touch bar style exit devices are suitable for all wide doors \r\n(aluminum, hollow metal, or wood) where there is no projection on the door face. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nTheses exit devices are non-handed and for doors 38\" - 48\" wide. The latch and springs are made from long lasting high strength stainless steel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nManufactured of extruded anodized aluminum, the EDTBAR44 is durable enough for the most demanding applications. A rim cylinder is included, and can also be used in conjunction with any of the exit device trims listed below.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available: <a href=\"/products/44-inch-stainless-steel-grade-2-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-edtbar44ss\"><b> Stainless Steel 44 Inch Panic Device </b></a>\r\n</p>\t\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nFeatures and Specifications: </b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Extruded anodized aluminum push bar, stainless steel springs</li>\r\n<li>Latch: Stainless Steel, 3/4\" throw - 5/8\" deadlatch</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" Covers 161 prep, includes latch & strike filler plates</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Surface mounted for 5/8\" stop with shim</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\" -  1-7/8\" dogged </li>\r\n<li>Stile: 4-1/2\" minimum</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Reversible, non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1 3/4\" standard</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: 38\" - 48\", can be field sized</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: Recommended installation at 41\" from finished floor to center line of push rail</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Furnished with sheet metal and machine screws</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Rim included, all key trims cylinder included</li>\r\n<li>Dogging: Allen key</li>\r\n<li>Fire Rating: Available Option</li>\r\n<li>Grade 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Exterior Trim:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/pull-trim-with-rim-cylinder-for-exit-device-global-th1100-pled-rc\">Pull Plate with Rim Lock Cylinder</a>: Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Unlatch (Open) door from exterior with Key. Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/pull-plate-trim-for-exit-device-global-th1100-pldum-al\">Pull Plate</a>: Dummy Function - Used as a door pull only.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/exit-only-block-off-plate-for-exit-device-global-th1100-pleo-al\">Exit Only Plate</a>: Blank block off plate covers pre drilled holes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/entry-lever-for-panic-device-global-th1100-lhed\">Keyed Classroom Lever</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key.  ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storeroom-lever-for-panic-device-global-th1100-lhst\">Keyed Storeroom Lever</a>: Storeroom Function (ANSI F09) - Outside entrance by lever only when released by key (Lever only opens door when the key is turned). Key removable only when locked. ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/passage-lever-for-panic-device-global-th1100-lhps\">Passage Lever</a>: Passage  Function (ANSI F14) - Outside entrance by lever for doors that don't need locking. ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/entry-knob-for-panic-device-global-th1100-baled\">Keyed Classroom Ball Knob</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key. </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/escutcheon-plate-classroom-lever-for-rim-exit-device\">Escutcheon Plate Keyed Classroom Lever</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key. Escutcheon Plate (2-1/2\" wide x 8-7/8\" high) with ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/exterior-handleset-for-panic-device-global-th1100-dumed-al\">Dummy Handleset</a>: Dummy Function - Used as a door pull only.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/night-latch-handleset-for-panic-device-global-th1100-nled-al\">Night Latch Handleset</a>: Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Unlatch (Open) door from exterior with Key. Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/thumb-lift-handleset-for-panic-device-global-th1100-tped-al\">Thumb Lift Classroom Handleset</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Thumb Lift locked and unlocked by Key.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
